L000210	
L000211	\textbf{Derivation of Eq. (3):} For the isotropic initial conditions that we consider, the mass conservation equation becomes,
L000212	
L000213	$    \frac{\partial \rho}{\partial t} + \frac{1}{r^{d-1}}\frac{\partial (\rho r^{d-1}v)}{\partial r}=0$,
L000214	
L000215	where $v$ is the radial velocity. Plugging the self-similar ansatz, Eq.~\ref{self-similar ansatz}, and requiring that the solution must not depend explicitly on time, gives $\gamma = -\beta d$.
L000216	
