L000291	Diffusion measurement is presented in Fig.~\ref{fig:Sio expriment}G. Diffusion was measured for a dilute suspension of PS particles without an external magnetic field. Diffusion was extracted from the slope and is $D = 0.02 \mu{\rm m}^2/s$.
